# Pipeline bodies: the Using: of Map Each is an indented pipeline rather than
# a lambda, so a per-row job can use primitives (here Sum By, the fused
# key-lambda fold) that the expression layer has no spelling for.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Cursed Technique: Split Each by " "
Channeled Energy: Convert Each List to Integers
Cursed Technique: Map Each
    Maximum Technique: Sum By
        Using: (x) -> x * x
Maximum Technique: Max
Reveal: stdout
